"""The Build specialist -- Phase 9. Receives a TaskContract with
capability_class of either `module_dev` (routes through the Phase 8
scaffold/lint/install toolchain) or `data_change` (routes through the
Phase 7 OdooToolClient directly, never touching module-dev tools at
all -- handing deployment tools to a data-only task would grant more
capability than the task's own classification says it needs).

Loads the actual Odoo Development Agent Constitution in full
(specialists.constitution) plus the relevant skill file as part of its
own system prompt for every task, per the build plan's own instruction
-- never a cached or summarized copy.

`check_fence()` is called immediately before every real Odoo write this
specialist makes -- not optional. `compensating_actions` are filled in,
per real step, as they actually execute -- never left generic or
empty -- so a cut-off mid-task carries enough information for
manager.compensations.run_compensations() to actually clean up.
"""

